some excersises and after all you might give me something that I need". 
So I approached the nymph and "How about one or two slashes".

The nymph replied, "Ok, but give me your ring first" and gone.

"So you want to play mouse and cat? No problem". Close my eyes and,
"Ah, there you are; hiding on a secret passageway that I had overlooked"
"Don't go away. Here I come".

After awhile, I got it, I got it, and I got the message:
- "The nymph pretend to be friendly."
- "The nymph stole your uncursed blindfold. You can see again"

Damn monster.

Lesson: Drop your blindfold before attacking a nymph

